# Implementation Plan - Phase 2: Professional Enhancements

## Goal
Elevate the API 650 Tank Design Calculator from a basic design tool to a professional-grade engineering suite. This involves implementing missing API chapters, enhancing calculation rigor, and improving user experience.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> This phase involves significant code expansion. New modules will be created for Venting and Nozzles. Existing modules (Roof, Shell) will be refactored to support advanced types.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Venting Design (API 2000)
**Current Status:** Placeholder in Report.
**Plan:**
- Create `Venting_Design.py`.
- Implement API 2000 7th Ed logic for:
    - Normal Venting (Inbreathing/Outbreathing) based on liquid movement and thermal effects.
    - Emergency Venting (Fire Case).
- Integrate into [app.py](file:///g:/%EB%8B%A4%EB%A5%B8%20%EC%BB%B4%ED%93%A8%ED%84%B0/%EB%82%B4%20%EB%85%B8%ED%8A%B8%EB%B6%81/API650_Project/app.py) UI (new Tab or Sub-section).
- Add results to Report.

### 2. Advanced Roof Design
**Current Status:** Only "Supported Cone Roof".
**Plan:**
- Update [Roof_Design.py](file:///g:/%EB%8B%A4%EB%A5%B8%20%EC%BB%B4%ED%93%A8%ED%84%B0/%EB%82%B4%20%EB%85%B8%ED%8A%B8%EB%B6%81/API650_Project/Roof_Design.py) to support:
    - **Self-Supported Cone Roof** (API 650 5.10.5)
    - **Self-Supported Dome/Umbrella Roof** (API 650 5.10.6)
- Add inputs for specific geometry (Radius of curvature, etc.).
- Update BOM generation for these types.

### 3. Wind Girder Design (Top & Intermediate)
**Current Status:** Basic Top Angle check.
**Plan:**
- Create `Wind_Girder_Design.py` or enhance [Shell_Design.py](file:///g:/%EB%8B%A4%EB%A5%B8%20%EC%BB%B4%ED%93%A8%ED%84%B0/%EB%82%B4%20%EB%85%B8%ED%8A%B8%EB%B6%81/API650_Project/Shell_Design.py).
- Calculate transformed shell height to determine if Intermediate Wind Girders are required (API 650 5.9).
- Design the section properties (Section Modulus) for required girders.

### 4. Nozzle & Manhole Design (API 650 5.7)
**Current Status:** None.
**Plan:**
- Create UI for defining Nozzle Bill of Material (List of nozzles: Size, Elevation, Service).
- Perform generic reinforcement Area Check (A_required vs A_available).
- Generate a "Nozzle Schedule" table in the report.

### 5. Shell Design Enhancements
**Current Status:** 1-Foot Method implemented. VDM exists in code but verified if accessible.
**Plan:**
- Verify/Expose **Variable Design Point Method** (VDM) in UI.
- Add **Annex S (Stainless Steel)** and **Annex X (Duplex)** specific stress logic if not fully covered.
- Add **Annex A (Small Tanks)** logic (optional logic).

### 6. Visualization & UI
**Current Status:** SVG for Roof.
**Plan:**
- Add **Shell Course Stackup Diagram** (SVG).
- Add **Nozzle Location Map** (SVG).
- Improve Report Layout (CSS).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Create `test_venting.py` to verify API 2000 calcs against standard examples.
- Create `test_advanced_roof.py`.

### Manual Verification
- Generate Report and check against manual Excel sheets or known examples.
